# Package Index

## `@lyterion/ai-provider`
`getAIModel(task)` / `getModelId(task)` resolve the model for a task (`candidatePick`, `candidatePickHard`), `isProviderConfigured(task)` gates on the credential, `withLLMRetry()` shares 429-aware backoff. The only place allowed to construct a provider client.

## `@lyterion/auth`
`createAuth()`: one Better Auth instance, Spotify OAuth at `/api/auth`. Import the live instance from `@lyterion/core`.

## `@lyterion/common`
Business logic and Trigger.dev tasks. Layout per `docs/architecture.md`: `spotify/`, `identity/`, `providers/`, `verify/`, `library/`, `trigger/tasks/`.

## `@lyterion/config`
Shared `tsconfig.base.json`.

## `@lyterion/core`
Wires `database` and `auth` singletons so packages never import each other in a cycle.

## `@lyterion/db`
Drizzle schema (`src/schema/`), generated migrations (`src/migrations/`), `db` client on `pg`.

## `@lyterion/env`
Zod env presets: `apiEnv`, `dashboardEnv`, `dbEnv`. Server code imports `@lyterion/env/server`.

## `@lyterion/logger`
Pino logger.

## `@lyterion/orpc`
Routers, `publicProcedure` / `protectedProcedure`, context, typed client.

## `@lyterion/ui`
shadcn/ui components, theme tokens, `Providers`.
